  "title": {
   "en": "Me after you"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "Have you ever wondered what it's like to be a fangirl in secret? Meet Soeyeon, a high school student head over heels for one of the country's rising idols, Minyun. It's a feeling she's ready to hide all her life. But when Soeyeon finds herself in a situation beyond her wildest dreams, how far will she go to keep her secret?"
